// Primary composites, sorted by the PAIR: a | b | composed. This is
// NOT the inverse of the table above — composition recombines one step
// at a time, so the key is the one-step pair. Composition-excluded
// characters are omitted, which is how Full_Composition_Exclusion is
// represented here.
